   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CC WIOMSA Climate change</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CC WIOMSA klimat</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet omfattar identifiering av forsknings-luckor och en ans&#xf6;kningsomg&#xe5;ng f&#xf6;r forskningsprojekt inom omr&#xe5;det  klimat-f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar, information till l&#xe4;nderna i den regionala att genomf&#xf6;ra anpassnings&#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder, granska klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringarna  relaterade regionala konventioner och organisera en regional h&#xf6;gniv&#xe5;spr&#xe5;k ministerniv&#xe5; conferance samt f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkning av WIOMSA som</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project include identification of research gaps and a call for research proposals in the area of climate change, providing  information to countries in the regional to implement adaptation measures, reviewing climate-change related regional conventions and organizing a regional highlevel ministerial conferance as well as the strengthening of WIOMSA as a regional research council.</narrative>
  </description>
